{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaNYtthbA5ihno4z2D4S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the `sorry` in `myRev_append` with a proof, and `lean Main.lean` now runs with no errors or warnings.\n\nThe proof works by induction on `xs`:\n\n```lean\ntheorem myRev_append (xs ys : List α) : myRev (xs ++ ys) = myRev ys ++ myRev xs := by\n  induction xs with\n  | nil => simp [myRev]\n  | cons x xs ih => simp [myRev, ih, List.append_assoc]\n```\n\n- **Empty list (`nil`):** `myRev ([] ++ ys)` simplifies to `myRev ys ++ []`, which is just `myRev ys`.\n- **Non-empty list (`cons`):** Unfolding `myRev` gives `myRev (xs ++ ys) ++ [x]`. The induction hypothesis rewrites that to `(myRev ys ++ myRev xs) ++ [x]`, and moving the brackets with `List.append_assoc` makes it match the right-hand side."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":447,"cache_read_input_tokens":7866,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":447},"output_tokens":334,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d19ea0d-84be-4760-ae04-4d7059c75ed2","uuid":"75b5b30b-5e13-4f56-8ae3-dcf7acf40ebf","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:12:08.307Z","request_id":"req_011CgaNYtfZHaDWCqLEP7Vd2"}
